# {{title}}

A task and motion planner for [tandem](https://github.com/SamratSahoo/tandem), generated by
`tandem planners new {{name}}`.

tandem plans the task: it splits an instruction into robot and human phases, hands the human ones
to a person, and checks their work from a photo. For a robot phase it asks a planner for one thing
-- *achieve this goal in this scene, and record what you did* -- and this package is that planner.

As generated it runs a stand-in world, one block and one tray planned and "executed" in memory, so
tandem's conformance kit passes before any real planner is wired in. Replace each `TODO` with your
planner and keep the kit green as you go.

